('payments-mobility', 'Payments + Mobility: Why EV Charging Is Becoming One of the Most Important Transaction Categories | NetworkCore', 'Discover how payments and mobility are converging around EV charging. Learn why EV charging is becoming critical financial infrastructure for platforms.', '/images/blog/payments-mobility.jpg', 'blog'),
